// PARAM: --analysis interval --context call-string --context-depth 4
// Backs the k = 4 row of the site's "The price of precision" recursion chart:
// concretely n stays in [0,5], but with call strings of depth 4 the deepest context
// merges the remaining calls and is widened to [-inf,1], so n >= 0 is UNKNOWN there.
// EXPECT-GRAPH-BEGIN
// clusters:
//   cluster_ctx_0: main / root context
//     main_exit_main_ctx0
//     main_pp5_ctx0
//     main_pp6_ctx0
//     main_entry_main_ctx0
//   cluster_ctx_1: down / call-string=pp2 pp2 pp2 pp2
//     down_pp1_ctx0
